# Route: guide 2 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 12 to 15, 49
# quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tirisfal Glades): Brill -> Garren's Haunt -> Brill -> Stillwater Pond
# -> Brill -> Stillwater Pond -> Solliden Farmstead -> Deathknell ->
# Whispering Forest -> Deathknell -> Agamand Mills -> Brill -> Garren's Haunt
# -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Rear Guard Patrol (99156; Riptear
# 13); Whispering Horror Residue (95328; Whispering Horror 11-13).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 97951 Camping
# 101: Alchemy; 97952 Camping 101: Blacksmithing; 97953 Camping 101:
# Enchanting; 97954 Camping 101: Engineering; 97955 Camping 101: First Aid;
# 97956 Camping 101: Fishing; 97957 Camping 101: Herbalism; 97958 Camping 101:
# Leatherworking; 97959 Camping 101: Mining; 97960 Camping 101: Skinning;
# 97961 Camping 101: Tailoring.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288).

